### Vehicle Management Tests
### Make sure to authenticate first using the auth endpoints to get access tokens
### Replace {{accessToken}} with a valid JWT access token from authentication

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

@accessToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjEsImVtYWlsIjoidGVzdEBleGFtcGxlLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJjdXN0b21lciIsImlhdCI6MTc2MDEyNjk4NSwiZXhwIjoxNzYwMTMwNTg1fQ.t4d8SVONI2cR4MBqAwK4QNh7xDkGgjhYnfHVuEpO3Ck

### 1. Create a Four-Wheeler Vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "ABC-1234",
  "vehicleType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "ownerName": "John Doe",
  "ownerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "ownerPhone": "+1234567890"
}

### 2. Create a Two-Wheeler Vehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "XYZ-5678",
  "vehicleType": "TWO_WHEELER",
  "ownerName": "Jane Smith",
  "ownerEmail": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "ownerPhone": "+1234567891"
}

### 3. Create Vehicle with Minimal Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "MIN-9999",
  "vehicleType": "FOUR_WHEELER"
}

### 4. Get All Vehicles (with pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Get All Vehicles with Filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?vehicleType=FOUR_WHEELER&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Search Vehicles by License Plate
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?licensePlate=ABC&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Search Vehicles by Owner Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?ownerName=John&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Get Vehicle by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Get Vehicle by License Plate
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/license/ABC-1234
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Update Vehicle Information
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "ownerName": "John Updated Doe",
  "ownerEmail": "john.updated@example.com",
  "ownerPhone": "+1234567899"
}

### 11. Update Vehicle Type
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/2
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "vehicleType": "FOUR_WHEELER"
}

### 12. Get Vehicle Statistics (Admin/Manager only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Delete Vehicle (Admin/Manager only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Test Invalid License Plate Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "invalid-format",
  "vehicleType": "FOUR_WHEELER"
}

### 15. Test Duplicate License Plate
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "ABC-1234",
  "vehicleType": "TWO_WHEELER"
}

### 16. Test Invalid Vehicle Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "INV-0001",
  "vehicleType": "INVALID_TYPE"
}

### 17. Test Invalid Email Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "INV-0002",
  "vehicleType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "ownerEmail": "invalid-email"
}

### 18. Test Invalid Phone Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "licensePlate": "INV-0003",
  "vehicleType": "FOUR_WHEELER",
  "ownerPhone": "invalid-phone"
}

### 19. Test Get Non-existent Vehicle
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 20. Test Update Non-existent Vehicle
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "ownerName": "Updated Name"
}

### 21. Test Delete Non-existent Vehicle
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 22. Test Access Without Authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles

### 23. Test Access with Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### 24. Test Large Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?page=1&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 25. Test Negative Page Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?page=-1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 26. Test Zero Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?page=1&limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 27. Test Multiple Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?vehicleType=FOUR_WHEELER&ownerName=John&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 28. Test Empty Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?licensePlate=&ownerName=&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 29. Test Special Characters in Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?ownerName=John%20Doe&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 30. Test Case Sensitivity
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles?licensePlate=abc-1234&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
